WEBVTT

NOTE Machine translated from English captions; target=rw.

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.960
Iyi videwo isobanura uburyo bwo gutegura umwana na nyina, cyangwa kurera, mbere yo gukora ikigega-umutuku

2
00:00:06.960 --> 00:00:10.840
ibizamini bya reflex mubana bavutse ndetse nabana bakuru.

3
00:00:10.840 --> 00:00:14.720
Umwana agomba gufatwa neza, ariko neza,

4
00:00:14.720 --> 00:00:20.524
haba ku bibero hejuru y'urutugu, cyangwa niba umwana aryamye ku mugongo.

5
00:00:20.524 --> 00:00:23.840
Ni ngombwa kuri bo kumva bafite umutekano.

6
00:00:23.840 --> 00:00:28.640
Abana bato barashobora gutuza kandi birashobora gukenerwa.

7
00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:35.600
Gusuzuma nyuma gato yo kugaburira birashobora gufasha kuko bazaruhuka kandi basinziriye gato.

8
00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:40.800
Abana bacu bose barashobora gutuza bakina igikinisho mugihe gito.

9
00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:46.560
Vuga nijwi ryinshuti hanyuma ugerageze kumanuka kurwego rwamaso yabo.

10
00:00:46.560 --> 00:00:52.080
Sobanura ibyo ugiye gukora kandi wunguke igitekerezo mbere yuko utangira.

11
00:00:52.080 --> 00:00:57.493
Ubwa mbere, baza nyina cyangwa ubyiteho niba nta kibi bafite

12
00:00:57.493 --> 00:00:59.040
ijisho ry'umwana cyangwa iyerekwa

13
00:00:59.040 --> 00:01:01.880
nigihe kingana iki badafite ikibazo.

14
00:01:01.880 --> 00:01:04.720
Ubukurikira, reba mu maso h'umwana no mu maso.

15
00:01:04.720 --> 00:01:06.336
Ibaze ibibazo bimwe.

16
00:01:06.336 --> 00:01:11.184
Umwana asa nkaho afite ububabare mumaso imwe cyangwa yombi?

17
00:01:11.184 --> 00:01:12.800
Amaso arakinguye

18
00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:15.488
cyangwa barayifunga cyane?

19
00:01:15.488 --> 00:01:18.560
Haba kuvomera cyangwa gusohoka mumaso?

20
00:01:18.560 --> 00:01:21.440
Amaso angana?

21
00:01:21.440 --> 00:01:23.000
Amaso ye yarabyimbye?

22
00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:26.040
Noneho, tekereza uko umwana abona.

23
00:01:26.040 --> 00:01:31.040
Himura mu maso hawe buhoro buhoro uruhande rumwe, urebe amaso.

24
00:01:31.040 --> 00:01:32.880
Umwenyure.

25
00:01:32.880 --> 00:01:37.040
Umwana akurikiza kugenda mumaso yawe?

26
00:01:37.040 --> 00:01:39.840
Cyangwa subiza kumwenyura?

27
00:01:39.840 --> 00:01:42.040
Ongera wibaze ibibazo bimwe.

28
00:01:42.040 --> 00:01:45.440
Amaso yombi aragenda yisanzuye kandi hamwe?

29
00:01:45.440 --> 00:01:51.040
Amaso aragororotse, cyangwa ijisho rimwe rihindukira imbere cyangwa hanze?

30
00:01:51.040 --> 00:01:54.670
Amaso arahungabana?

31
00:01:54.670 --> 00:01:59.866
Urashobora kandi gukoresha amatara kuri arclight n'amashusho ya

32
00:01:59.866 --> 00:02:01.350
uburiri kugirango ubone ibitekerezo

33
00:02:01.350 --> 00:02:04.590
no gusuzuma ireme ry'icyerekezo.

34
00:02:04.590 --> 00:02:08.230
Himura uruhande rwerekanwe kuruhande no hepfo.

35
00:02:08.230 --> 00:02:13.470
Reba kugirango urebe niba umwana arimo gukosora no gukurikiza intego.

36
00:02:13.470 --> 00:02:17.790
Iyo bageze bakerekana neza kuri

37
00:02:17.790 --> 00:02:22.110
intego, akenshi ijisho rimwe gusa ntirishobora kubona neza.

38
00:02:22.110 --> 00:02:26.830
Wowe cyangwa nyoko urashobora gupfuka ijisho rimwe, hanyuma irindi.

39
00:02:26.830 --> 00:02:32.784
Himura intego hanyuma ugereranye uko umwana yitwara mugihe ukoresheje amaso yombi,

40
00:02:32.784 --> 00:02:34.910
hanyuma umwe umwe.

41
00:02:34.910 --> 00:02:40.323
Niba umwana adakunda ijisho rimwe ripfukiranwa, byerekana ko bitapfunditswe

42
00:02:40.323 --> 00:02:41.870
ijisho ntiribona

43
00:02:41.870 --> 00:02:42.870
neza.

44
00:02:42.870 --> 00:02:48.602
Niba utekereza ko ushobora kubona ikintu kibi ukoresheje ijisho ryo hanze, reba byinshi

45
00:02:48.602 --> 00:02:49.830
