46
00:02:49.830 --> 00:02:52.870
iherezo ryumucyo.

47
00:02:52.870 --> 00:02:58.310
Zimya amatara hanyuma uzamuke hafi ya cm 6.

48
00:02:58.310 --> 00:03:04.390
Urashobora gukenera gukoresha urutoki rwawe kugirango ufungure buhoro buhoro.

49
00:03:04.390 --> 00:03:07.390
Ibaze ibibazo bimwe.

50
00:03:07.390 --> 00:03:12.470
Igice cyera cyijisho ryijimye?

51
00:03:12.470 --> 00:03:19.670
Uyu munyeshuri cyangwa cornea imvi cyangwa umweru ni uruziga rwimboni y'ijisho.

52
00:03:19.670 --> 00:03:23.190
Urashobora kubona imibiri y'amahanga?

53
00:03:23.190 --> 00:03:26.550
Noneho uriteguye gukora ikizamini cya reflex.
